
package bid754

// decNumber third-oracle differential gate: shared pure-Go support.
//
// This file is tag-free so the portable build type-checks it and the
// hand-written comparator strength anchor
// (decnumber_comparator_strength_test.go) can exercise the comparator and
// the flag projection without cgo. It carries the independent BID triple
// codec (emitted from the devtools bid_codec_reference layout logic;
// production codec and the Go mechanical port are never used to decode),
// the exact comparison surface, the fixed decNumber status projection
// table, the deterministic random-triple stream, and every anchored
// constant of the decnumber_differential gate.
//
// decNumber is a divergence tripwire, not a correctness definition: any
// mismatch inside the generated corpus fails the gate and is resolved
// through the documented four-way procedure (harness fix, pinned known
// divergence, IEEE-deviation registration, or a generation-time exclusion
// class change, which is a spec change).

